{%- comment -%}
  Reviews block — integrity-first review system:
  1. If verified ratings exist (product reviews metafields, e.g. Judge.me /
     Okendo / Shopify Product Reviews sync them), they render here.
  2. If the merchant enables SAMPLE mode (settings), clearly-labelled sample
     reviews render for development ONLY — never presented as real.
  3. Otherwise: an honest empty state.
  Review apps can also inject via @app blocks in the product template.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value -%}
{%- assign rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | default: 0 -%}

{%- if rating and rating_count > 0 -%}
  <div class="reviews-summary">
    <div class="reviews-summary__score">
      <div class="big">{{ rating | round: 1 }}</div>
      <span class="stars" aria-label="{{ rating }} out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>
      <p class="small muted mt-2">{{ rating_count }} verified review{% if rating_count != 1 %}s{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="small muted">Reviews are published only after we verify a matching order.</p>
      {%- if product.metafields.reviews.reviews_list != blank -%}
        <div class="reviews-grid mt-4">
          {%- for review in product.metafields.reviews.reviews_list.value limit: 6 -%}
            <article class="review-card">
              <div class="review-card__head">
                <div class="review-card__avatar">{{ review.author | slice: 0 }}</div>
                <div>
                  <div class="review-card__name">{{ review.author }}</div>
                  <div class="review-card__meta">{{ review.rating }} ★
                    <span class="verified-pill">✓ Verified purchase</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <strong>{{ review.title }}</strong>
              <p>{{ review.body }}</p>
            </article>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

{%- elsif settings.show_sample_reviews -%}
  <div class="demo-banner" style="margin-bottom:24px">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8h.01M12 11v5"/></svg>
    <span><strong>Sample content (development preview).</strong> The reviews below are clearly-labelled design samples shown because “sample reviews” is enabled in theme settings. Turn the setting off before launch — fabricated reviews are never used.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="reviews-summary">
    <div class="reviews-summary__score">
      <div class="big">5.0</div>
      <span class="stars">★★★★★</span>
      <p class="small muted mt-2">2 sample reviews</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reviews-summary__bars">
      <div class="rbar"><span>5 ★</span><div class="rbar__track"><div class="rbar__fill" style="width:100%"></div></div><span>100%</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="reviews-grid">
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-card__head">
        <div class="review-card__avatar">A</div>
        <div>
          <div class="review-card__name">Sample review — Amara O.</div>
          <div class="review-card__meta">5 ★ <span class="verified-pill">✓ Sample · verified format</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <strong>Exactly the architectural look we wanted</strong>
      <p>The up-down beam pattern looks beautiful on our limestone entry wall. Finish feels substantial, not hollow. Installation took about 30 minutes with an existing junction box.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-card__head">
        <div class="review-card__avatar">D</div>
        <div>
          <div class="review-card__name">Sample review — Daniel R.</div>
          <div class="review-card__meta">5 ★ <span class="verified-pill">✓ Sample · verified format</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <strong>Soft warm glow, no harsh glare</strong>
      <p>We flanked our patio doors with two. The 3000 K temperature is warm without being yellow, and the diffuser hides the LEDs completely.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

{%- else -%}
  <div class="empty-state">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.3 6.9.8-5.1 4.7 1.4 6.8L12 17.2 5.9 20.6l1.4-6.8L2.2 9.1l6.9-.8L12 2z"/></svg>
    <p><strong>{{ 'products.product.no_reviews_yet' | t }}</strong></p>
    <p class="small muted">Reviews appear here after verified customers share theirs. We only publish reviews from real, confirmed orders.</p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
